[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "scandi-main 4.d4"]
[Name "4...e6: the same set-up by another order"]

4... e6 { The second most common reply. Black plays the pawn before the knight. }
5. Nf3 { The same set-up. If the bishop comes out first with 5...Bb4, play Bd3 and castle all the same. }
5... Nf6 { Back in the line you know, by another order. } *
